e screen.\\n- **Excel Synchronization**:\\n  - `apply_reviews` updates the `ملخص` sheet cells, updates `history.db`, and saves the workbook cleanly.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Global Re-Run Modal Overlay & Concurrency Lock\\n- **Global Modal Overlay**:\\n  - Moved `#progress-modal` from inside `screen-new` to a fixed full-\n<truncated 3037 bytes>","Description":"\"Walkthrough artifact of all implemented changes and test results\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing walkthrough artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Create walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
